Third-party data: models.dev model database

pkg/pricecatalog/snapshot_modelsdev.json is a trimmed extract of the model files
under providers/ in the models.dev project (https://github.com/sst/models.dev),
taken at the commit and date recorded in the "meta" object of that file. Only
text token prices, context limits and source links for a subset of providers
are kept; the values are copied unchanged and converted to exact decimals per
million tokens.

The repository is licensed under the MIT licence below. The licence text is
reproduced exactly as published at the pinned commit
(pkg/pricecatalog/LICENSE.modelsdev is the same text).

The prices are a third-party snapshot: they can be stale or wrong, they are
public list prices, and they do not reflect discounts or commitments.

